											<span class="telemetry-tag telemetry-tag--canary">
												EXPECT
											</span>{" "}
											{Route.Expect}
										</p>
									</div>
								</div>
							</div>
						</div>
					))}
				</div>
			</div>

			<p class="mt-8 font-mono text-base text-zinc-dust">
				All four routes converge on the same two directories -
				<a
					class="text-weathered-teal underline transition-colors hover:text-bone-white"
