					what changes on disk
				</a>
				.
			</p>
			<ZineSource
				Lines={[
					"SRC: docs/install/index.md; docs/install/macos-linux.md",
					"SRC: docs/install/windows.md (download.ps1)",
				]}
			/>
		</section>

		<!-- 04 // PERSISTENCE ARCHITECTURE - the canonical layout every route
		     converges on, the same layout read as a path table, and the eight
		     steps that produce it. -->
		<section class="blueprint-section relative w-full" data-reveal>
			<p class="section-index">
				04 // PERSISTENCE ARCHITECTURE // AFTER ANY ROUTE // THE LAYOUT
			</p>
			<h2 id="layout" class="mt-3 type-section text-bone-white">
				What changes on disk
			</h2>
			<div class="mt-8 grid grid-cols-1 items-start gap-8 lg:grid-cols-5">
				<!-- LEFT: the tree itself, on the plate that already carries it -
